@startuml implantacao
title MecaFlow — Diagrama de Implantação (Docker / Cloud)
skinparam shadowing false

node "Dispositivo do Usuário" {
  artifact "Navegador Web" as browser
}

cloud "Provedor Cloud" {
  node "Vercel / Netlify" {
    artifact "Build estático React (/dist)" as front
  }
  node "Railway / Render" {
    node "Container: api" {
      artifact "mecaflow-api.jar\n(Spring Boot / JRE 21)" as api
    }
    node "Container: db" {
      database "PostgreSQL 16" as pg
    }
  }
}

browser --> front : HTTPS
front --> api : HTTPS  /api
api --> pg : JDBC (porta 5432)

note bottom of api
  Variáveis de ambiente injetadas pelo provedor:
  SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL, SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME,
  SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD, JWT_SECRET.
end note

@enduml
